msgid "TMG import failed"
msgstr "TMG uvoz nije usio"

msgid ""
"The current Family Tree is not empty.\n"
"\n"
"Please create a new empty Family Tree before importing a TMG backup file."
msgstr ""
"Trenutačni rodoslov nije prazan.\n"
"\n"
"Prije uvoza TMG datoteke sigurnosne kopije, stvori nov prazan rodoslov."

msgid ""
"The TMG backup file could not be read: PJC version information is missing or "
"unreadable.\n"
"\n"
"Please ensure you are using a backup created by TMG 9.02 or later "
"(PjcVersion >= 11.0)."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka sigurnosne kopije TMG-a se nije mogla pročitati: Podaci o verziji "
"PJC-a nedostaju ili su nečitljivi.\n"
"\n"
"Provjeri je li koristiš sigurnosnu kopiju stvorenu pomoću TMG 9.02 ili "
"novije verzije (PjcVersion >= 11.0)."

msgid "TMG version not supported"
msgstr "TMG verzija nije nepodržana"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"This backup was created with an older version of TMG (PjcVersion %(ver)s, "
"equivalent to TMG 9.01 or earlier).\n"
"\n"
"Please upgrade your TMG project to version 9.05 and create a new backup, "
"then import again.\n"
"\n"
"See: https://gramps-project.org/wiki/index.php/"
"Addon:TMGimporter#Before_Import_From_TMG_Backup_file"
msgstr ""
"Ova je sigurnosna kopija stvorena sa starijom verzijom TMG-a (PjcVersion "
"%(ver)s, ekvivalentno TMG 9.01 ili starijoj).\n"
"\n"
"Aktualizirajsvoj TMG projekt na verziju 9.05 i stvori novu sigurnosnu "
"kopiju, zatim ponovo uvezi.\n"
"\n"
"Pogledaj: https://gramps-project.org/wiki/index.php/"
"Addon:TMGimporter#Before_Import_From_TMG_Backup_file"

msgid ""
"No datasets were found in this TMG backup file.\n"
"\n"
"The backup may be corrupt or empty."
msgstr ""
"U ovoj TMG sigurnosnoj datoteci nisu pronađeni skupovi podataka.\n"
"\n"
"Sigurnosna kopija je možda oštećena ili prazna."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(filename)s does not appear to be a valid TMG backup file.\n"
"\n"
"The file must be a TMG backup archive (*.SQZ) containing a project "
"configuration file (.PJC).\n"
"\n"
"Ensure the file was created by TMG version 5.x or later."
msgstr ""
"Čini se da %(filename)s nije valjana TMG datoteka sigurnosne kopije.\n"
"\n"
"Datoteka mora biti TMG arhiva sigurnosne kopije (*.SQZ) koja sadrži "
"konfiguracijsku datoteku projekta (.PJC).\n"
"\n"
"Provjeritje li datoteka stvorena pomoću TMG verzije 5.x ili novije."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Directly importing from TMG files is not supported\n"
"by the TMG Importer Addon.\n"
"\n"
"You need to use an backup copy of the TMG project(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Ensure that your TMG project was created by:\n"
"TMG version 5.x or greater.\n"
"\n"
"Your file:\n"
"*.PJC - Project Configuration File for TMG 5.0 to TMG 9.05\n"
"\n"
"Please refer to:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"
msgstr ""
"Dodatak „TGM uvoznik” ne podržava izravni\n"
"uvoz iz TMG datoteka.\n"
"\n"
"Moraš koristiti sigurnosnu kopiju TMG projekta (*.sqz).\n"
"\n"
"Provjeri je li tvoj TMG projekt stvoren pomoću:\n"
"TMG verzije 5.x ili novije.\n"
"\n"
"Tvoja datoteka:\n"
"*.PJC – Konfiguracijska datoteka projekta za TMG 5.0 do TMG 9.05\n"
"\n"
"Pogledaj:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Directly importing from TMG files is not supported\n"
"by the TMG Importer Addon.\n"
"\n"
"You need to use an backup copy of TMG project(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Ensure that your TMG project was created by:\n"
"TMG version 5.x or greater.\n"
"\n"
"Your file:\n"
"*.TMG - Version Control File for TMG 2.0 to TMG 4.0d\n"
"\n"
"Please refer to:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"
msgstr ""
"Dodatak „TGM uvoznik” ne podržava izravni uvoz\n"
"iz TMG datoteka.\n"
"\n"
"Moraš koristiti sigurnosnu kopiju TMG projekta (*.sqz).\n"
"\n"
"Provjeri je li tvoj TMG projekt stvoren pomoću:\n"
"TMG verzije 5.x ili novije.\n"
"\n"
"Tvoja datoteka:\n"
"*.TMG – Datoteka za upravljanje verzijama za TMG 2.0 do TMG 4.0d.\n"
"\n"
"Pogledaj:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Directly importing from TMG files is not supported\n"
"by the TMG Importer Addon.\n"
"\n"
"You need to use an backup copy of TMG project(*.sqz)\n"
"\n"
"Ensure that your TMG project was created by:\n"
"TMG version 5.x or greater.\n"
"\n"
"Your file:\n"
"*.VER - Version Control File for TMG 1.2 and earlier\n"
"\n"
"Please refer to:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"
msgstr ""
"Dodatak „TGM uvoznik” ne podržava izravni uvoz\n"
"iz TMG datoteka.\n"
"\n"
"Moraš koristiti sigurnosnu kopiju TMG projekta (*.sqz).\n"
"\n"
"Provjeri je li tvoj TMG projekt stvoren pomoću:\n"
"TMG verzije 5.x ili novije.\n"
"\n"
"Tvoja datoteka:\n"
"*.VER – Datoteka za upravljanje verzijama za TMG 1.2 i starije.\n"
"\n"
"Pogledaj:\n"
"%(gramps_wiki_import_pjc_direct_url)s"

msgid "TMG Project Backup"
msgstr "Sigurnosna kopija TMG projekta"

msgid "Import TMG project files"
msgstr "Uvezi datoteku TMG projekta"

msgid "TMG Unsupported"
msgstr "TMG nepodržan"

msgid "TMG Importer"
msgstr "TMG uvoznik"

msgid "Unreleased Addon - Work In Progress"
msgstr "Neobjavljen dodatak – Rad u tijeku"

msgid ""
"Wholly Genes - The Master Genealogist (TMG) Importer\n"
"\n"
"Select the TMG Data Set you wish to import."
msgstr ""
"Wholly Genes – The Master Genealogist (TMG) uvoznik\n"
"\n"
"Odaberi TMG skup podataka koji želiš uvesti."

msgid "Data Set Name"
msgstr "Ime skupa podataka"

